{"content_hash": "7201f1d5d19f3704", "version_id": 923, "article_id": 93, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "OnePlus Ace 7 adds a cooling fan and a 9000mAh battery for gamers", "title_zh": "一加Ace 7发布：内置风扇加9000mAh电池，专为游戏玩家打造", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "mydrivers_ev", "source_url": "https://news.mydrivers.com/1/1163/1163909.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600373633615-9b045feaa299?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8cHJvJTIwYWNlJTIwbWFofGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQyODIxOTB8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Badhan Ganesh on Unsplash", "author": "Badhan Ganesh", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@badhanganesh?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/ace-of-spade-playing-card-wYFYDP9r8BY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(28, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(66, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "5044abb86628"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-10", "word_count": 200, "reading_minutes": 1.0, "lead": "OnePlus has launched the Ace 7, a phone built mainly for people who play games for hours. It puts a real cooling fan inside the body, and it also carries a very large battery.", "lead_zh": "一加推出了Ace 7，这款手机主要面向长时间玩游戏的用户。它把真正的散热风扇装进了机身，同时还配了一块容量很大的电池。", "preview": "The Ace series has always focused on gaming performance, and the new model goes further than before. OnePlus installed an active fan inside ", "preview_zh": "Ace系列一直主打游戏性能，而新机型比以往走得更远。一加在手机内部装入了主动风扇，两条独立风道分别把芯片和手握区域的热量排出。虽然设计更复杂，但整机看起来仍像普通旗舰。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 909, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 83.025, "size_bytes": 499104, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 238, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 85.55, "size_bytes": 514224, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 238, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/93/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 90.45, "size_bytes": 543600, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 238, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/93/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 77.15, "size_bytes": 463824, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 238, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/93/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/93/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 84.875, "size_bytes": 510192, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 238, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/93/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@0cb59f2/content/data/versions/923.json", "paragraphs": ["The Ace series has always focused on gaming performance, and the new model goes further than before. OnePlus installed an active fan inside the phone, and two separate air paths push heat away from the chip and from the area where your hands rest. Although the design is more complex, the phone still looks like a normal flagship.", "Because the fan is built in, the phone stays cool during long sessions. The company says the cooling system lowered temperatures by nearly 10°C in tests, and games ran smoothly at up to 185 frames per second. The screen is a 185Hz panel, the same type used on the OnePlus 16.", "Inside, the Ace 7 runs on the fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite V series chip, which keeps the 4.6GHz prime core. A 9000mAh battery supports long gaming, and 100W fast charging tops it up quickly. The phone also has a 200-megapixel main camera, so everyday photos remain strong.", "The body keeps the familiar metal frame and rounded corners, and it still meets IP66, IP68, IP69 and IP69K dust and water resistance. OnePlus clearly aimed this standard model at serious mobile gamers, so buyers get flagship-level features without paying for the Pro version."], "paragraphs_zh": ["Ace系列一直主打游戏性能，而新机型比以往走得更远。一加在手机内部装入了主动风扇，两条独立风道分别把芯片和手握区域的热量排出。虽然设计更复杂，但整机看起来仍像普通旗舰。", "由于风扇内置，手机在长时间游戏时能保持凉爽。官方称散热系统在测试中让温度降低了近10°C，游戏最高可跑到185帧且运行流畅。屏幕为185Hz面板，与一加16所用同款。", "配置上，Ace 7搭载第五代骁龙8至尊版V系列芯片，保留4.6GHz超大核。9000mAh电池支持长时间游戏，100W快充可快速补电。手机还配有2亿像素主摄，日常拍照依然出色。", "机身延续熟悉的金属中框和圆角设计，并仍支持IP66、IP68、IP69和IP69K防尘防水。一加显然把这款标准版对准了重度手游玩家的需求，因此用户不必买Pro版也能获得旗舰级配置。"], "body": "The Ace series has always focused on gaming performance, and the new model goes further than before. OnePlus installed an active fan inside the phone, and two separate air paths push heat away from the chip and from the area where your hands rest. Although the design is more complex, the phone still looks like a normal flagship.\n\nBecause the fan is built in, the phone stays cool during long sessions. The company says the cooling system lowered temperatures by nearly 10°C in tests, and games ran smoothly at up to 185 frames per second. The screen is a 185Hz panel, the same type used on the OnePlus 16.\n\nInside, the Ace 7 runs on the fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite V series chip, which keeps the 4.6GHz prime core. A 9000mAh battery supports long gaming, and 100W fast charging tops it up quickly. The phone also has a 200-megapixel main camera, so everyday photos remain strong.\n\nThe body keeps the familiar metal frame and rounded corners, and it still meets IP66, IP68, IP69 and IP69K dust and water resistance. OnePlus clearly aimed this standard model at serious mobile gamers, so buyers get flagship-level features without paying for the Pro version.", "body_zh": "Ace系列一直主打游戏性能，而新机型比以往走得更远。一加在手机内部装入了主动风扇，两条独立风道分别把芯片和手握区域的热量排出。虽然设计更复杂，但整机看起来仍像普通旗舰。\n\n由于风扇内置，手机在长时间游戏时能保持凉爽。官方称散热系统在测试中让温度降低了近10°C，游戏最高可跑到185帧且运行流畅。屏幕为185Hz面板，与一加16所用同款。\n\n配置上，Ace 7搭载第五代骁龙8至尊版V系列芯片，保留4.6GHz超大核。9000mAh电池支持长时间游戏，100W快充可快速补电。手机还配有2亿像素主摄，日常拍照依然出色。\n\n机身延续熟悉的金属中框和圆角设计，并仍支持IP66、IP68、IP69和IP69K防尘防水。一加显然把这款标准版对准了重度手游玩家的需求，因此用户不必买Pro版也能获得旗舰级配置。", "text": "The Ace series has always focused on gaming performance, and the new model goes further than before. OnePlus installed an active fan inside the phone, and two separate air paths push heat away from the chip and from the area where your hands rest. Although the design is more complex, the phone still looks like a normal flagship. Because the fan is built in, the phone stays cool during long sessions. The company says the cooling system lowered temperatures by nearly 10°C in tests, and games ran smoothly at up to 185 frames per second. The screen is a 185Hz panel, the same type used on the OnePlus 16. Inside, the Ace 7 runs on the fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite V series chip, which keeps the 4.6GHz prime core. A 9000mAh battery supports long gaming, and 100W fast charging tops it up quickly. The phone also has a 200-megapixel main camera, so everyday photos remain strong. The body keeps the familiar metal frame and rounded corners, and it still meets IP66, IP68, IP69 and IP69K dust and water resistance. OnePlus clearly aimed this standard model at serious mobile gamers, so buyers get flagship-level features without paying for the Pro version.", "vocab": [{"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布，推出", "note": "常用于新产品上市", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "performance", "pos": "noun", "zh": "性能", "note": "指设备运行能力", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "install", "pos": "verb", "zh": "安装", "note": "install sth inside/in sth", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "separate", "pos": "adj", "zh": "分开的，独立的", "note": "强调各自独立", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "although", "pos": "conj", "zh": "虽然", "note": "引导让步状语从句", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "lower", "pos": "verb", "zh": "降低", "note": "lower the temperature", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "smoothly", "pos": "adv", "zh": "流畅地", "note": "形容运行顺畅", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "panel", "pos": "noun", "zh": "屏幕面板", "note": "指显示面板", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "resistance", "pos": "noun", "zh": "抵抗，防护能力", "note": "water resistance 防水", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "aim at", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "针对，瞄准", "note": "aim sth at sb/sth", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-10T03:43:09.016021", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.375, "sm": 250, "em": 375, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Ace", "s": 0.375, "e": 0.625, "sm": 375, "em": 625, "cs": 4, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "series", "s": 0.625, "e": 1.012, "sm": 625, "em": 1012, "cs": 8, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "has", "s": 1.012, "e": 1.188, "sm": 1012, "em": 1187, "cs": 15, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "always", "s": 1.188, "e": 1.575, "sm": 1187, "em": 1574, "cs": 19, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "focused", "s": 1.575, "e": 1.962, "sm": 1575, "em": 1962, "cs": 26, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "on", "s": 1.962, "e": 2.15, "sm": 1962, "em": 2150, "cs": 34, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "gaming", "s": 2.15, "e": 2.525, "sm": 2150, "em": 2525, "cs": 37, "ce": 43, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "performance", "s": 2.525, "e": 3.4, "sm": 2525, "em": 3400, "cs": 44, "ce": 55, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": ",", "s": 3.4, "e": 3.5, "sm": 3400, "em": 3500, "cs": 55, "ce": 56, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "and", "s": 3.5, "e": 3.612, "sm": 3500, "em": 3612, "cs": 57, "ce": 60, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "the", "s": 3.612, "e": 3.7, "sm": 3612, "em": 3699, "cs": 61, "ce": 64, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "new", "s": 3.7, "e": 3.875, "sm": 3700, "em": 3874